:0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"yamen-haddad","id":22749018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22749018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad","html_url":"https://github.com/yamen-haddad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/3469130498","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/27021#issuecomment-3469130498","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/27021","id":3469130498,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc7OxrsC","user":{"login":"yamen-haddad","id":22749018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzQ5MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22749018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad","html_url":"https://github.com/yamen-haddad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T17:17:48Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T17:17:48Z","body":"> Moreover, I also don't see any persistence of the rollback state to disk so we also appear to not rollback if the master restarts after AlterTable completes but before the DDL finishes.\n\nI was writing a basic test where I crashed the master in the middle of DDL. I wanted to check if we roll back the DDL in DocDB. However, the test was passing (which was unexpected from the persistent perspective).\nDigging deeper, it turns out we persist `ysql_ddl_txn_verifier_state` in disk by chance as a by-product of calling `CatalogManager::SendAlterTableRequest` :\n```\n{\n      LOG(INFO) << \"Persist transaction metadata into SysTableEntryPB for table ID \" << table->id();\n      TRACE(\"Locking table\");\n      auto l = table->LockForWrite();\n      auto& tablet_data = *l.mutable_data();\n      auto& table_pb = tablet_data.pb;\n      table_pb.mutable_transaction()->CopyFrom(req->transaction());\n\n      // Update sys-catalog with the transaction ID.\n      TRACE(\"Updating table metadata on disk\");\n      RETURN_NOT_OK(sys_catalog_->Upsert(epoch, table.get()));\n\n      // Update the in-memory state.\n      TRACE(\"Committing in-memory state\");\n      l.Commit();\n    }\n```\nHere we are only saving the transaction info. However, `ysql_ddl_txn_verifier_state` is already committed in-memory, and that's how it gets persisted by chance.\nWe still have a small window between committing in-memory and before executing `CatalogManager::SendAlterTableRequest` where a DDL will not be rolled back in case of a master crash. I am 